       Identification Division.                                         00010099
       Program-ID. F115L070.                                            00020099
       Author.  Hallvard Barman.                                        00030099
      *################################################################*00040099
      *                                                                 00050099
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060099
      *                                                                 00070099
      *                                                                 00080099
      * Lists charges. The amounts/percentages presented have been      00090099
      * computed from occurences on TF_Main_Charge and TF_Part_Charge   00100099
      * in accordance with the "Method_Of_Calculation" pertaining to    00110099
      * each particular charge type.                                    00120099
      *                                                                 00130099
      * As "-In-Action", use "-In-Add" if you need figures for          00140099
      * presentation to the end user or for settlement.                 00150099
      *                                                                 00160099
      * Use "-In-Subtract" if you need to modify input figures from the 00170099
      * end user in connection with updates of TF_Main_Charge and/or    00180099
      * TF_Part_Charge.                                                 00190099
      *                                                                 00200099
      * NB! This module does not present the figures as they appear from00210099
      * any of the two database tables. If you need figures that have   00220099
      * NOT been modified, use module F115L060!                         00230099
      *                                                                 00240099
      *################################################################*00250099
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00260099
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00270099
      *191001!NDL! % av type PA feilretting                      !LO18! 00280099
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00290099
      *170901!NDL! Agent Commision - Feilretting                 !LO18! 00300099
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00310099
      *110901!NDL! Feilrettinger, beregner % av PA utfra rate    !LM04! 00320099
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00330099
      *300699!HB ! New module                                    !LG10! 00340099
      *################################################################*00350099
       Environment Division.                                            00360099
       Configuration Section.                                           00370099
       Special-Names.                                                   00380099
           Decimal-Point Is Comma.                                      00390099
      *                                                                 00400099
      *################################################################*00410099
       Data Division.                                                   00420099
       Working-Storage Section.                                         00430099
      *                                                                 00440099
       01  W-IO-Length                   Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00450099
      *                                                                 00460099
       01  W-Fields.                                                    00470099
      *                                                                 00480099
         05  W-Ind1                      Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00490099
         05  W-Ind2                      Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00500099
      *                                                                 00510099
         05  WS-Display-Am1              Pic  zzzzzz9999v999.           00520099
         05  WS-Display-Am2              Pic  zzzzzz9999v999.           00530099
      *                                                                 00540099
         05  WS-CA-or-PA-Amount          Pic  S9(15)V9(03)       Comp-3.00550099
         05  WS-Charge-Amount            Pic  S9(15)V9(03)       Comp-3.00560099
         05  WS-Percent                  Pic  S9(03)V9(03).             00570099
      *                                                                 00580099
         05  SW-Tables-Read              Pic S9                  Comp-3.00590099
           88  SW-Read-Main-Part             Value +1.                  00600099
           88  SW-Read-Main-Only             Value +2.                  00610099
           88  SW-Read-Part-Only             Value +3.                  00620099
      *                                                                 00630099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00640099
      * Internal area:                                                  00650099
      *                                                                 00660099
       01  W-Int-IO-Area.                                               00670099
           Copy R115L070.                                               00680099
      *                                                                 00690099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00700099
      * Assorted copy-areas:                                            00710099
      *                                                                 00720099
       01  W-R115L060.                                                  00730099
         02  W-R115L060-Work.                                           00740099
             Copy R115L060.                                             00750099
         02  W-R115L060-Main.                                           00760099
             Copy R115L060.                                             00770099
         02  W-R115L060-Part.                                           00780099
             Copy R115L060.                                             00790099
      *                                                                 00800099
             Copy R115IPA0.                                             00810099
             Copy R115ICA0.                                             00820099
      *                                                                 00830099
      * Get error message.                                              00840099
       01  Filler.                                                      00850099
           Copy R7918030.                                               00860099
      *                                                                 00870099
      * External data.                                                  00880099
       Copy R115X000.                                                   00890099
      *                                                                 00900099
      *################################################################.00910099
       Linkage Section.                                                 00920099
      *                                                                 00930099
       01  L-Ext-IO-Area                 Pic  X(11328).                 00940099
      *                                                                 00950099
      * Error handling.                                                 00960099
       Copy R7919999.                                                   00970099
      *                                                                 00980099
      *################################################################.00990099
       Procedure Division                Using L-Ext-IO-Area            01000099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area.     01010099
      *                                                                 01020099
       A000-Main                         Section.                       01030099
      *                                                                 01040099
           Perform B000-Initialize                                      01050099
      *                                                                 01060099
           Perform ZI00-Konv-Input-Version                              01070099
           Perform C000-Interface                                       01080099
           Perform ZO00-Konv-Output-Version                             01090099
      *                                                                 01100099
           Goback                                                       01110099
           .                                                            01120099
      *################################################################*01130099
       B000-Initialize                   Section.                       01140099
      *                                                                 01150099
           Set   R7919999-Return-OK      To    True                     01160099
           Initialize                          W-Fields                 01170099
           Initialize                          W-R115L060               01180099
           .                                                            01190099
      *################################################################.01200099
       C000-Interface                    Section.                       01210099
      *                                                                 01220099
           Evaluate True also True                                      01230099
             When R115L070-In-Add                                       01240099
             also R115L070-In-PA-Seq-No  =     +0                       01250099
               Perform C100-Initialize-Output                           01260099
               Perform C200-Qualify-Read                                01270099
               Perform C300-Read-Main-Charge                            01280099
               Set   SW-Read-Main-Only   To    True                     01290099
               Perform D000-Pre-Process-Charges                         01300099
               Perform J000-Output-Fields                               01310099
      *                                                                 01320099
             When R115L070-In-Add                                       01330099
             also R115L070-In-PA-Seq-No  not = +0                       01340099
               Perform C100-Initialize-Output                           01350099
               Perform C200-Qualify-Read                                01360099
               If R115L070-In-Operation-Type(1:6)                       01370099
                                         =     'AMEND-'                 01380099
                 Perform C400-Read-Part-Charge                          01390099
                 Set   SW-Read-Part-Only   To    True                   01400099
                 Perform D000-Pre-Process-Charges                       01410099
               Else                                                     01420099
      * Feilretting NDL, 19.10.01, må si fra hvilken rate vi er på      01430099
                 Move R115L070-In-Pa-Seq-No                             01440099
                                           To    R115L060-In-Check-Pa   01450099
                                           in    W-R115L060-Main        01460099
                 Perform C300-Read-Main-Charge                          01470099
                 Perform C400-Read-Part-Charge                          01480099
                 Set   SW-Read-Main-Part   To    True                   01490099
                 Perform D000-Pre-Process-Charges                       01500099
                 Perform E000-Process-Charges                           01510099
               End-If                                                   01520099
               Perform J000-Output-Fields                               01530099
      *                                                                 01540099
             When R115L070-In-Subtract                                  01550099
             also R115L070-In-PA-Seq-No  =     +0                       01560099
               Continue                                                 01570099
      *                                                                 01580099
             When R115L070-In-Subtract                                  01590099
             also R115L070-In-PA-Seq-No  not = +0                       01600099
               If not R115L070-In-Operation-Type(1:6)                   01610099
                                         =     'AMEND-'                 01620099
                 Perform C200-Qualify-Read                              01630099
                 Perform C300-Read-Main-Charge                          01640099
      *          Perform C400-Read-Part-Charge                          01650099
      *          Set   SW-Read-Main-Part   To    True                   01660099
                 Set   SW-Read-Main-Only   To    True                   01670099
                 Perform D000-Pre-Process-Charges                       01680099
                 Perform F000-Process-New-Charges                       01690099
               End-If                                                   01700099
      *                                                                 01710099
             When other                                                 01720099
               Move  'GL-IN-AKSJON-UV'   To R7918030-In-MessageCode     01730099
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)01740099
               Move  R115L070-In-Action  To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)01750099
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               01760099
               Move  'C001'              To R7919999-Paragraph          01770099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       01780099
      *                                                                 01790099
           End-Evaluate                                                 01800099
           .                                                            01810099
      *################################################################*01820099
       C100-Initialize-Output            Section.                       01830099
      *                                                                 01840099
           Initialize                          R115L070-Data            01850099
      *                                                                 01860099
           Compute                             R115L070-Max-Tab-Occ     01870099
               =  ( Length               of    R115L070-Charge-Tab      01880099
               -    Length               of    R115L070-Max-Tab-Occ     01890099
               -    Length               of    R115L070-No-Tab-Occ )    01900099
               /  ( Length               of    R115L070-Charge-Element) 01910099
           End-Compute                                                  01920099
           .                                                            01930099
      *################################################################*01940099
       C200-Qualify-Read                 Section.                       01950099
      *                                                                 01960099
           Initialize                          W-R115L060-Work          01970099
           Set   R115L060-Version        in    W-R115L060-Work          01980099
                                         To    True                     01990099
      *                                                                 02000099
           Evaluate True                                                02010099
             When R115L070-In-Actual                                    02020099
               Set   R115L060-In-Actual  in    W-R115L060-Work          02030099
                                         To    True                     02040099
             When R115L070-In-Work                                      02050099
               Set   R115L060-In-Work    in    W-R115L060-Work          02060099
                                         To    True                     02070099
           End-Evaluate                                                 02080099
      *                                                                 02090099
           Move  R115L070-In-Read-From   To    R115L060-In-Read-From    02100099
                                         In    W-R115L060-Work          02110099
           Move  R115L070-In-Read-To     To    R115L060-In-Read-To      02120099
                                         In    W-R115L060-Work          02130099
      *                                                                 02140099
           Move  R115L070-In-Fin-Inst-No To    R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No  02150099
                                         In    W-R115L060-Work          02160099
      *                                                                 02170099
           Move  R115L070-In-Reg-No      To    R115L060-In-Reg-No       02180099
                                         In    W-R115L060-Work          02190099
      *                                                                 02200099
           Move  R115L070-In-Contract-Type                              02210099
                                         To    R115L060-In-Contract-Type02220099
                                         In    W-R115L060-Work          02230099
           Move  R115L070-In-Contract-No To    R115L060-In-Contract-No  02240099
                                         In    W-R115L060-Work          02250099
      *                                                                 02260099
           Move  R115L070-In-PA-Seq-No   To    R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No    02270099
                                         In    W-R115L060-Work          02280099
      *                                                                 02290099
           Move  R115L070-In-Operation-Type                             02300099
                                         To   R115L060-In-Operation-Type02310099
                                         In   W-R115L060-Work           02320099
      *                                                                 02330099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02340099
      * If a part amount no is supplied, both TF_Main_Charge and        02350099
      * TF_Part_Charge are relevant. If no part amount no is supplied,  02360099
      * TF_Main_Charge only will be relevant.                           02370099
      *                                                                 02380099
           If  R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No                                    02390099
           in  W-R115L060-Work           not = +0                       02400099
             Move  W-R115L060-Work       To    W-R115L060-Part          02410099
             Move  W-R115L060-Work       To    W-R115L060-Main          02420099
             Move  Zero                  To    R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No    02430099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main          02440099
      *                                                                 02450099
           Else                                                         02460099
             Move  W-R115L060-Work       To    W-R115L060-Main          02470099
      *                                                                 02480099
           End-If                                                       02490099
           .                                                            02500099
      *################################################################*02510099
       C300-Read-Main-Charge             Section.                       02520099
      *                                                                 02530099
           Call  'F115L060'              Using W-R115L060-Main          02540099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      02550099
           End-Call                                                     02560099
      *                                                                 02570099
           Evaluate True                                                02580099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 02590099
               Move  'C231'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       02600099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02610099
                                                                        02620099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 02630099
               Move  'C232'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       02640099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    02650099
                                                                        02660099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    02670099
               Continue                                                 02680099
                                                                        02690099
                                                                        02700099
           End-Evaluate                                                 02710099
           .                                                            02720099
      *################################################################*02730099
       C400-Read-Part-Charge           Section.                         02740099
      *                                                                 02750099
           Call  'F115L060'            Using W-R115L060-Part            02760099
                                             R7919999-Error-Area        02770099
           End-Call                                                     02780099
      *                                                                 02790099
           Evaluate True                                                02800099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 02810099
               Move  'C233'            To    R7919999-Paragraph         02820099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02830099
                                                                        02840099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 02850099
               Move  'C234'            To    R7919999-Paragraph         02860099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    02870099
                                                                        02880099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    02890099
               Continue                                                 02900099
                                                                        02910099
           End-Evaluate                                                 02920099
           .                                                            02930099
      *################################################################*02940099
       D000-Pre-Process-Charges          Section.                       02950099
      *                                                                 02960099
           Evaluate True                                                02970099
             When SW-Read-Main-Part                                     02980099
             When SW-Read-Part-Only                                     02990099
      *                                                                 03000099
               Move  R115L060-Data       in    W-R115L060-Part          03010099
                 to  R115L060-Data       in    W-R115L060-Work          03020099
               Initialize                                               03030099
                 R115L060-Totals-Seller  in    W-R115L060-Work          03040099
               Initialize                                               03050099
                 R115L060-Totals-Buyer   in    W-R115L060-Work          03060099
               Initialize                                               03070099
                 R115L060-Totals-Agent   in    W-R115L060-Work          03080099
      *                                                                 03090099
             When SW-Read-Main-Only                                     03100099
               Move  R115L060-Data       in    W-R115L060-Main          03110099
               to    R115L060-Data       in    W-R115L060-Work          03120099
      *                                                                 03130099
           End-Evaluate                                                 03140099
      *                                                                 03150099
           If  SW-Read-Main-Part                                        03160099
      *                                                                 03170099
               Perform varying W-Ind1                                   03180099
               from +1 by +1 until                                      03190099
                 W-Ind1                  >     R115L060-No-Tab-Occ      03200099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          03210099
                     Perform D100-Check-Consistency                     03220099
                     If W-Ind1           >     +1                       03230099
                       Perform D200-Check-Paying-Party                  03240099
                     End-If                                             03250099
      *                                                                 03260099
               End-Perform                                              03270099
           End-If                                                       03280099
      *                                                                 03290099
           .                                                            03300099
      *################################################################*03310099
       D100-Check-Consistency            Section.                       03320099
      *                                                                 03330099
      * Between the two lists, there should always be a one-one         03340099
      * correspondence with respect to Charge Type and Role Type.       03350099
      *                                                                 03360099
           If Not                                                       03370099
            (                                                           03380099
             R115L060-Charge-Type        in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  03390099
                 =                                                      03400099
             R115L060-Charge-Type        in    W-R115L060-Part(W-Ind1)  03410099
           and                                                          03420099
             R115L060-Charge-Role-Type   in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  03430099
                 =                                                      03440099
             R115L060-Charge-Role-Type   in    W-R115L060-Part(W-Ind1)  03450099
            )                                                           03460099
      *                                                                 03470099
           Then                                                         03480099
             Initialize                     R7918030-ErrorMessage       03490099
             Move  'TF-SY-INCONSISTENCY-VAR1'                           03500099
                                         To R7918030-In-MessageCode     03510099
             Move  'VAR1'                To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)03520099
             Move  'F115L070'            To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)03530099
             Perform Z000-Error-Message                                 03540099
             Move  'D101'                To R7919999-Paragraph          03550099
             Perform Z900-Abend                                         03560099
      *                                                                 03570099
           End-If                                                       03580099
           .                                                            03590099
      *################################################################*03600099
       D200-Check-Paying-Party           Section.                       03610099
      *                                                                 03620099
           Compute                             W-Ind2                   03630099
               =                               W-Ind1                   03640099
               -                               1                        03650099
           End-Compute                                                  03660099
      *                                                                 03670099
           If  R115L060-Charge-Type      in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  03680099
                   =                                                    03690099
               R115L060-Charge-Type      in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)  03700099
      *                                                                 03710099
           Then                                                         03720099
      *                                                                 03730099
               Evaluate R115L060-Charge-Amount                          03740099
               in W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1) not = Zero                    03750099
      *                                                                 03760099
               Also     R115L060-Charge-Amount                          03770099
               in W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2) not = Zero                    03780099
      *                                                                 03790099
               Also     R115L060-Charge-Amount                          03800099
               in W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1) not = Zero                    03810099
      *                                                                 03820099
               Also     R115L060-Charge-Amount                          03830099
               in W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind2) not = Zero                    03840099
      *                                                                 03850099
      * The same charge has been regstered twice on Part_Charge.        03860099
                   When True also True also Any also Any                03870099
                     Move  'TF-SY-DUPLICATE-CHARGE'                     03880099
                                         To R7918030-In-MessageCode     03890099
                     Move  'VAR1'        To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)03900099
                     Move  R115L060-Charge-Type                         03910099
                                         in W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)     03920099
                                         To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)03930099
                     Perform Z000-Error-Message                         03940099
                     Move  'D201'              To R7919999-Paragraph    03950099
                     Perform Z900-Abend                                 03960099
      *                                                                 03970099
      * The same charge has been regstered twice on Main_Charge.        03980099
                   When Any also Any also True also True                03990099
                     Move  'TF-SY-DUPLICATE-CHARGE'                     04000099
                                         To R7918030-In-MessageCode     04010099
                     Move  'VAR1'        To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)04020099
                     Move  R115L060-Charge-Type                         04030099
                                         in W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)     04040099
                                         To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)04050099
                     Perform Z000-Error-Message                         04060099
                     Move  'D202'              To R7919999-Paragraph    04070099
                     Perform Z900-Abend                                 04080099
      *                                                                 04090099
      * Paying party differs between Main_ and Part_Charge.             04100099
      * Part_Charge takes precedence.                                   04110099
                   When True also False also False also True            04120099
                     Perform D230-Modify-Entries                        04130099
      *                                                                 04140099
      * Paying party differs between Main_ and Part_Charge.             04150099
      * Part_Charge takes precedence.                                   04160099
                   When False also True also True also False            04170099
                     Perform D260-Modify-Entries                        04180099
      *                                                                 04190099
               End-Evaluate                                             04200099
           .                                                            04210099
      *################################################################*04220099
       D230-Modify-Entries               Section.                       04230099
      *                                                                 04240099
           Evaluate True                                                04250099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-CA                           04260099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                               04270099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA                           04280099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                               04290099
      *                                                                 04300099
                  Move Zero              To   R115L060-Charge-Amount    04310099
                                         in   W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind2)   04320099
                  Move Zero              To   R115L060-Charge-Percentage04330099
                                         in   W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind2)   04340099
      *                                                                 04350099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Settlement                          04360099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                               04370099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Part-Amount                         04380099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                               04390099
      *                                                                 04400099
                  Move R115L060-Charge-Amount                           04410099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind2)  04420099
                  To   R115L060-Charge-Amount                           04430099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  04440099
                  Move Zero              To    R115L060-Charge-Amount   04450099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind2)  04460099
      *                                                                 04470099
           End-Evaluate                                                 04480099
           .                                                            04490099
      *################################################################*04500099
       D260-Modify-Entries               Section.                       04510099
      *                                                                 04520099
           Evaluate True                                                04530099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-CA                           04540099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)                               04550099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA                           04560099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)                               04570099
      *                                                                 04580099
                  Move Zero              To   R115L060-Charge-Amount    04590099
                                         in   W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)   04600099
                  Move Zero              To   R115L060-Charge-Percentage04610099
                                         in   W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)   04620099
      *                                                                 04630099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Settlement                          04640099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)                               04650099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Part-Amount                         04660099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)                               04670099
      *                                                                 04680099
                  Move R115L060-Charge-Amount                           04690099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  04700099
                  To   R115L060-Charge-Amount                           04710099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind2)  04720099
                  Move Zero              To    R115L060-Charge-Amount   04730099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  04740099
      *                                                                 04750099
           End-Evaluate                                                 04760099
           .                                                            04770099
      *################################################################*04780099
       E000-Process-Charges              Section.                       04790099
      *                                                                 04800099
           Perform varying W-Ind1                                       04810099
           from +1 by +1                                                04820099
           until W-Ind1                  >                              04830099
                 R115L060-No-Tab-Occ     in    W-R115L060-Work          04840099
      *                                                                 04850099
                 Perform E100-Merge-Charges                             04860099
                 Perform E200-Accumulate-Totals                         04870099
      *                                                                 04880099
           End-Perform                                                  04890099
           .                                                            04900099
      *################################################################*04910099
       E100-Merge-Charges                Section.                       04920099
      *                                                                 04930099
      * Determining the charges based on the values on Main_ and        04940099
      * Part_Charge, and the Method of Calculation pertaining to        04950099
      * each particular Charge Type.                                    04960099
      *                                                                 04970099
           Evaluate True                                                04980099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-CA                           04990099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                               05000099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA                           05010099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                               05020099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  05030099
      *      If the Part_Charge percent value is greater than zero,     05040099
      *      any such Main_Charge value is to be ignored. If the        05050099
      *      Part_Charge percent value is zero, we shall use the        05060099
      *      Main_Charge percent value.                                 05070099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  05080099
               If  R115L060-Charge-Amount                               05090099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  05100099
                                         =     Zero                     05110099
      * NEW! start                                                      05120099
               and R115L060-Charge-Percentage                           05130099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  05140099
                                         =     Zero                     05150099
      * NEW! end                                                        05160099
      *        and R115L060-Charge-Percentage                           05170099
      *                                  in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  05180099
      *                                  Not = Zero                     05190099
                     Move  R115L060-Charge-Amount                       05200099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  05210099
                     To    R115L060-Charge-Amount                       05220099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  05230099
                     Move  R115L060-Charge-Percentage                   05240099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  05250099
                     To    R115L060-Charge-Percentage                   05260099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  05270099
      *Feilretting start                                                05280099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  05290099
      *      If the Main_Charge percent value is used, we must check    05300099
      *      that amount is inside valid ranges, calculated with        05310099
      *      the value of Part Amount                                   05320099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  05330099
      *Her må vi justere i forhold til max og min, og prosent av rate   05340099
                   If   R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA                     05350099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  05360099
                   And  R115L060-Charge-Percentage                      05370099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  05380099
                                               > +0                     05390099
                   And  R115L070-In-PA-Seq-No  > 0                      05400099
      *                                                                 05410099
                     Perform E300-Read-Contract-Amount                  05420099
                     Perform E400-Read-Part-Amount                      05430099
      *                                                                 05440099
                     Move R115IPA0-Amount                               05450099
                                         To    Ws-CA-Or-PA-Amount       05460099
                     Move R115L060-Charge-Percentage                    05470099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  05480099
                                         To    Ws-Percent               05490099
      *                                                                 05500099
                     If  not WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount  =  Zero                05510099
                                                                        05520099
                         Compute               WS-Charge-Amount         05530099
                         Rounded                                        05540099
                             =                 WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       05550099
                             *                 WS-Percent               05560099
                             /                     100                  05570099
                         End-Compute                                    05580099
                     Else                                               05590099
                         Move  R115L060-Charge-Amount                   05600099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  05610099
                                         To    Ws-Charge-Amount         05620099
                     End-If                                             05630099
      *                                                                 05640099
      *  Under min?                                                     05650099
                     If Ws-Charge-Amount  <    R115L060-Minimum-Charge  05660099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  05670099
                     And Ws-Charge-Amount      > +0                     05680099
      *                                                                 05690099
      *                 flytter min til charge-amount                   05700099
                        Move R115L060-Minimum-Charge                    05710099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  05720099
                                         To    Ws-Charge-Amount         05730099
      *                 Beregner ny prosent                             05740099
                                                                        05750099
                        Compute                WS-Percent               05760099
                            =                  WS-Charge-Amount         05770099
                            *                  100                      05780099
                            /                  WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       05790099
                        End-Compute                                     05800099
      *                                                                 05810099
                        Move  Ws-Percent                                05820099
                                         To   R115L060-Charge-Percentage05830099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  05840099
                     End-If                                             05850099
      *                                                                 05860099
      *  Over max?                                                      05870099
                     If  R115L060-Maximum-Charge                        05880099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  05890099
                                          >    +0                       05900099
                     And Ws-Charge-Amount >    R115L060-Maximum-Charge  05910099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  05920099
                     And Ws-Charge-Amount >    +0                       05930099
      *                                                                 05940099
      *              flytter max til charge-amount                      05950099
                        Move R115L060-Maximum-Charge                    05960099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  05970099
                                         To    Ws-Charge-Amount         05980099
      *                                                                 05990099
      *                 Beregner ny prosent                             06000099
                                                                        06010099
                        Compute                WS-Percent               06020099
                            =                  WS-Charge-Amount         06030099
                            *                  100                      06040099
                            /                  WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       06050099
                        End-Compute                                     06060099
      *                                                                 06070099
                        Move  Ws-Percent                                06080099
                                         To   R115L060-Charge-Percentage06090099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  06100099
                     End-If                                             06110099
      *                                                                 06120099
                     Move  Ws-Charge-Amount                             06130099
                                         To    R115L060-Charge-Amount   06140099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  06150099
                  End-If                                                06160099
      *Feilretting slutt                                                06170099
      *                                                                 06180099
               End-If                                                   06190099
      *                                                                 06200099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Settlement                          06210099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                               06220099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Part-Amount                         06230099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                               06240099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  06250099
      *      The matching occurences on Part_Charge and Main_Charge     06260099
      *      are to be added.                                           06270099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  06280099
               Add  R115L060-Charge-Amount                              06290099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main(W-Ind1)  06300099
               To   R115L060-Charge-Amount                              06310099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  06320099
      *                                                                 06330099
           End-Evaluate                                                 06340099
           .                                                            06350099
      *################################################################*06360099
       E200-Accumulate-Totals            Section.                       06370099
      *                                                                 06380099
      * Accumulating sums per paying party and per paid party.          06390099
      *                                                                 06400099
           Evaluate True also True                                      06410099
      *      When  R115L060-Seller                                      06420099
      *        in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06430099
      *      also  R115L060-Credit-Agent-Bank                           06440099
      *        in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06450099
      *        Add   R115L060-Charge-Amount                             06460099
      *                                  in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  06470099
      *        To    R115L060-Ch-Seller-Cred-Agent                      06480099
      *                                  in    W-R115L060-Work          06490099
      *                                                                 06500099
             When  R115L060-Seller                                      06510099
               in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06520099
             also  R115L060-Credit-Other-Bank                           06530099
               in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06540099
               Add   R115L060-Charge-Amount                             06550099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  06560099
               To    R115L060-Ch-Seller-Cred-T-Bank                     06570099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          06580099
      *                                                                 06590099
             When  R115L060-Seller                                      06600099
               in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06610099
             also  R115L060-Credit-Own-Bank                             06620099
               in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06630099
               Add   R115L060-Charge-Amount                             06640099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  06650099
               To    R115L060-Ch-Seller-Cred-W-Bank                     06660099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          06670099
      *                                                                 06680099
      *      When  R115L060-Buyer                                       06690099
      *        in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06700099
      *      also  R115L060-Credit-Agent-Bank                           06710099
      *        in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06720099
      *        Add   R115L060-Charge-Amount                             06730099
      *                                  in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  06740099
      *        To    R115L060-Ch-Buyer-Cred-Agent                       06750099
      *                                  in    W-R115L060-Work          06760099
      *                                                                 06770099
             When  R115L060-Buyer                                       06780099
               in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06790099
             also  R115L060-Credit-Other-Bank                           06800099
               in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06810099
               Add   R115L060-Charge-Amount                             06820099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  06830099
               To    R115L060-Ch-Buyer-Cred-T-Bank                      06840099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          06850099
      *                                                                 06860099
             When  R115L060-Buyer                                       06870099
               in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06880099
             also  R115L060-Credit-Own-Bank                             06890099
               in  W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)                              06900099
               Add   R115L060-Charge-Amount                             06910099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind1)  06920099
               To    R115L060-Ch-Buyer-Cred-W-Bank                      06930099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          06940099
      *                                                                 06950099
           End-Evaluate                                                 06960099
      *                                                                 06970099
      * Computing grand totals.                                         06980099
      *                                                                 06990099
           Compute                       R115L060-Total-Charge-Seller   07000099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          07010099
      *        =                         R115L060-Ch-Seller-Cred-Agent  07020099
      *                                  in    W-R115L060-Work          07030099
      *        +                         R115L060-Ch-Seller-Cred-T-Bank 07040099
               =                         R115L060-Ch-Seller-Cred-T-Bank 07050099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          07060099
               +                         R115L060-Ch-Seller-Cred-W-Bank 07070099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          07080099
           End-Compute                                                  07090099
      *                                                                 07100099
           Compute                       R115L060-Total-Charge-Buyer    07110099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          07120099
      *        =                         R115L060-Ch-Buyer-Cred-Agent   07130099
      *                                  in    W-R115L060-Work          07140099
      *        +                         R115L060-Ch-Buyer-Cred-T-Bank  07150099
               =                         R115L060-Ch-Buyer-Cred-T-Bank  07160099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          07170099
               +                         R115L060-Ch-Buyer-Cred-W-Bank  07180099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          07190099
           End-Compute                                                  07200099
      *                                                                 07210099
           Compute                       R115L060-Tot-Agent-Commission  07220099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          07230099
               =                         R115L060-Tot-Agent-Commission  07240099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Main          07250099
               +                         R115L060-Tot-Agent-Commission  07260099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Part          07270099
      *    Compute                       R115L060-Tot-Agent-Commission  07280099
      *                                  in    W-R115L060-Work          07290099
      *        =                         R115L060-Ch-Seller-Cred-Agent  07300099
      *                                  in    W-R115L060-Work          07310099
      *        +                         R115L060-Ch-Buyer-Cred-Agent   07320099
      *                                  in    W-R115L060-Work          07330099
      *    End-Compute                                                  07340099
           .                                                            07350099
      *################################################################*07360099
       E300-Read-Contract-Amount         Section.                       07370099
      *                                                                 07380099
           Initialize                          R115ICA0-Contract-Amount 07390099
           Set   R115ICA0-Version        To    True                     07400099
           Set   R115ICA0-In-Get-1st     To    True                     07410099
      *                                                                 07420099
           Move  R115L070-In-Table-Version                              07430099
                                         To    R115ICA0-In-Table-Version07440099
      *                                                                 07450099
           Move  R115L070-In-Fin-Inst-No                                07460099
                                         To    R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-No  07470099
           Move  R115L070-In-Contract-Type                              07480099
                                         To    R115ICA0-In-Contract-Type07490099
           Move  R115L070-In-Contract-No                                07500099
                                         To    R115ICA0-In-Contract-No  07510099
      *                                                                 07520099
           Call  'F115ICA0'              Using R115ICA0-Contract-Amount 07530099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      07540099
           End-Call                                                     07550099
      *                                                                 07560099
           Evaluate True                                                07570099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 07580099
               Move  'E301'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07590099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       07600099
                                                                        07610099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 07620099
               Move  'E302'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07630099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    07640099
      *                                                                 07650099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    07660099
               Continue                                                 07670099
      *                                                                 07680099
           End-Evaluate                                                 07690099
           .                                                            07700099
      *                                                                 07710099
      *################################################################*07720099
       E400-Read-Part-Amount             Section.                       07730099
      *                                                                 07740099
           Initialize                          R115IPA0-Part-Amount     07750099
           Set   R115IPA0-Version        To    True                     07760099
           Set   R115IPA0-In-Select      To    True                     07770099
      *                                                                 07780099
           Move  R115L070-In-Table-Version                              07790099
                                         To    R115IPA0-In-Table-Version07800099
      *                                                                 07810099
           Move  R115L070-In-Fin-Inst-No                                07820099
                                         To    R115IPA0-In-Fin-Inst-No  07830099
           Move  R115L070-In-Contract-Type                              07840099
                                         To    R115IPA0-In-Contract-Type07850099
           Move  R115L070-In-Contract-No                                07860099
                                         To    R115IPA0-In-Contract-No  07870099
      *                                                                 07880099
           Move  R115ICA0-Currency       To    R115IPA0-In-CA-Currency  07890099
           Move  R115L070-In-PA-Seq-No                                  07900099
                                         To    R115IPA0-In-PA-Seq-No    07910099
      *                                                                 07920099
           Call  'F115IPA0'              Using R115IPA0-Part-Amount     07930099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      07940099
           End-Call                                                     07950099
      *                                                                 07960099
           Evaluate True                                                07970099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 07980099
               Move  'E301'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07990099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       08000099
                                                                        08010099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 08020099
               Move  'E302'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       08030099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    08040099
                                                                        08050099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    08060099
               Continue                                                 08070099
                                                                        08080099
           End-Evaluate                                                 08090099
      *                                                                 08100099
           .                                                            08110099
      *                                                                 08120099
      *################################################################*08130099
       F000-Process-New-Charges          Section.                       08140099
      *                                                                 08150099
      * Running through the input list of charge types...               08160099
      *                                                                 08170099
           Perform varying W-Ind1                                       08180099
           from +1 by +1                                                08190099
           until R115L070-Charge-Type(W-Ind1)                           08200099
                                         =     Spaces                   08210099
           or    W-Ind1                  >     R115L070-No-Tab-Occ      08220099
      *                                                                 08230099
      *    ...checking for stored values on TF_Main_Charge.             08240099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  08250099
             Perform varying W-Ind2                                     08260099
             from +1 by +1 until                                        08270099
                (                                                       08280099
                 R115L060-Charge-Type    in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)  08290099
                     =                                                  08300099
                 R115L070-Charge-Type(W-Ind1)                           08310099
               and                                                      08320099
                 R115L060-Charge-Role-Type                              08330099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)  08340099
                     =                                                  08350099
                 R115L070-Charge-Role-Type(W-Ind1)                      08360099
                )                                                       08370099
               or                                                       08380099
                 W-Ind2                  >     R115L060-No-Tab-Occ      08390099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          08400099
             End-Perform                                                08410099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  08420099
             If  not  W-Ind2             >     R115L060-No-Tab-Occ      08430099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work          08440099
      *                                                                 08450099
                 Perform F100-Modify-Input-Values                       08460099
      *                                                                 08470099
             End-If                                                     08480099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  08490099
           End-Perform                                                  08500099
           .                                                            08510099
      *################################################################*08520099
       F100-Modify-Input-Values             Section.                    08530099
      *                                                                 08540099
           Evaluate True                                                08550099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Settlement                          08560099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)                               08570099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Part-Amount                         08580099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)                               08590099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  08600099
      *      If a charge amount is stored on TF_Main_Charge, this       08610099
      *      amount is to be subtracted from the input value.           08620099
      *      Negative results are, however, not allowed.                08630099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  08640099
               Subtract  R115L060-Charge-Amount                         08650099
                                         in    W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)  08660099
               from      R115L070-Charge-Amount(W-Ind1)                 08670099
      *                                                                 08680099
               If R115L070-Charge-Amount(W-Ind1) < Zero                 08690099
                  Move  Zero                                            08700099
                  to    R115L070-Charge-Amount(W-Ind1)                  08710099
               End-If                                                   08720099
      *                                                                 08730099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-CA                           08740099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)                               08750099
             When R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA                           08760099
             in   W-R115L060-Work(W-Ind2)                               08770099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  08780099
      *      No action taken.                                           08790099
      *      ---------------------------------------------------------  08800099
               Continue                                                 08810099
      *                                                                 08820099
           End-Evaluate                                                 08830099
           .                                                            08840099
      *################################################################*08850099
       J000-Output-Fields                Section.                       08860099
      *                                                                 08870099
           Move  R115L060-Data           in    W-R115L060-Work          08880099
             to                                R115L070-Data            08890099
           .                                                            08900099
      *################################################################*08910099
       ZI00-Konv-Input-Version           Section.                       08920099
      *                                                                 08930099
      * Version control.                                                08940099
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         08950099
      *                                                                 08960099
           Set   R115L070-Version        To    True                     08970099
           Move  Length                  Of    R115L070-Comp-Charge     08980099
                                         To    W-IO-Length              08990099
      *                                                                 09000099
           Evaluate True                                                09010099
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115L070-Version-No      09020099
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            09030099
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              09040099
               Move  L-Ext-IO-Area (1:W-IO-Length)                      09050099
                                         To    W-Int-IO-Area            09060099
      *                                                                 09070099
             When Other                                                 09080099
               Call  'F115L999'                                         09090099
                   Using By Content      'F115L070 '                    09100099
                                         'INPUT '                       09110099
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  09120099
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  09130099
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            09140099
               End-Call                                                 09150099
      *                                                                 09160099
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                09170099
                   Move  'ZI01'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       09180099
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   09190099
               End-If                                                   09200099
      *                                                                 09210099
           End-Evaluate                                                 09220099
           .                                                            09230099
      *################################################################*09240099
       ZO00-Konv-Output-Version          Section.                       09250099
      *                                                                 09260099
      * Version control.                                                09270099
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         09280099
      *                                                                 09290099
           Evaluate True                                                09300099
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115L070-Version-No      09310099
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            09320099
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              09330099
               Move  W-Int-IO-Area       To    L-Ext-IO-Area            09340099
                                                         (1:W-IO-Length)09350099
      *                                                                 09360099
             When Other                                                 09370099
               Call  'F115L999'                                         09380099
                   Using By Content      'F115L070 '                    09390099
                                         'OUTPUT '                      09400099
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  09410099
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  09420099
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            09430099
               End-Call                                                 09440099
      *                                                                 09450099
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                09460099
                   Move  'ZO01'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       09470099
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   09480099
               End-If                                                   09490099
      *                                                                 09500099
           End-Evaluate                                                 09510099
           .                                                            09520099
      *################################################################*09530099
       Z000-Error-Message                Section.                       09540099
      *                                                                 09550099
           Set   R7918030-Version        To    True                     09560099
